#. Crowdin string 358158
msgctxt "Either the `publish` or `pages.publish` option may be present in `.gitlab-ci.yml`, but not both."
msgid "Either the `publish` or `pages.publish` option may be present in `.gitlab-ci.yml`, but not both."
msgstr "Antingen alternativet `publish` eller `pages.publish` får finnas i `.gitlab-ci.yml`, men inte båda."

#. Crowdin string 122920
msgctxt "Either the title or description must reference a Jira issue."
msgid "Either the title or description must reference a Jira issue."
msgstr "Antingen rubriken eller beskrivningen måste hänvisa till ett Jira-ärende."

#. Crowdin string 55314
msgctxt "EmailError|The thread you are replying to no longer exists, perhaps it was deleted? If you believe this is in error, contact a staff member."
msgid "EmailError|The thread you are replying to no longer exists, perhaps it was deleted? If you believe this is in error, contact a staff member."
msgstr "Tråden som du svarar på finns inte längre, kanske har den tagits bort? Kontakta en administratör om du tror att detta är ett fel."

#. Crowdin string 55316
msgctxt "EmailError|We couldn't figure out what the email is for. Please create your issue or comment through the web interface."
msgid "EmailError|We couldn't figure out what the email is for. Please create your issue or comment through the web interface."
msgstr "Vi kunde inte avgöra vad e-postmeddelandet avser. Skapa ditt ärende eller din kommentar via webbgränssnittet."

#. Crowdin string 55322
msgctxt "EmailError|We couldn't find the project. Please check if there's any typo."
msgid "EmailError|We couldn't find the project. Please check if there's any typo."
msgstr "Vi kunde inte hitta projektet. Kontrollera om det finns något skrivfel."

#. Crowdin string 55324
msgctxt "EmailError|We couldn't process your email because it is too large. Please create your issue or comment through the web interface."
msgid "EmailError|We couldn't process your email because it is too large. Please create your issue or comment through the web interface."
msgstr "Vi kunde inte behandla ditt e-postmeddelande eftersom det är för stort. Skapa ditt ärende eller din kommentar via webbgränssnittet."

#. Crowdin string 55326
msgctxt "EmailError|You are not allowed to perform this action. If you believe this is in error, contact a staff member."
msgid "EmailError|You are not allowed to perform this action. If you believe this is in error, contact a staff member."
msgstr "Du har inte behörighet att utföra denna åtgärd. Kontakta en administratör om du tror att detta är ett fel."

#. Crowdin string 55328
msgctxt "EmailError|Your account has been blocked. If you believe this is in error, contact a staff member."
msgid "EmailError|Your account has been blocked. If you believe this is in error, contact a staff member."
msgstr "Ditt konto har blockerats. Kontakta en administratör om du tror att detta är ett fel."

